        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-13T01:16:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been playing some randomized games lately, and Fanatic keeps coming up. &nbsp;I would like to use Zealous Offense more often, but as far as I can tell, the only dependable way to get it out is to have Absolution out first, since you have to deal 3HP damage the very round you play it, or it just goes away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any other tips/tricks for being able to play Zealous Offense that *DON'T* depend on &nbsp;other heroes (a) buffing Fanatic's damage (e.g., Legacy); or (b) giving her double/out-of-turn power activations?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:28.896Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
