        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-13T02:35:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that makes it tricky, but thematic. If you accept the premise that the card represents her being able to mount enough offense to keep enemies at bay, then it only makes sense to have it out when you can do that damage.</p><p>My advice is to get her an out-of-turn card play to put it in.</p>",
