        "id": 186881,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-13T17:24:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>I'll often set it up with Chastise, as that leaves you with 1 more damage to deal to keep it around. &nbsp;Sacrosanct Martyr is the best way to ensure it stays around, since in a pinch you can hit yourself for the needed damage.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>In a pinch I've set it up with Divine Focus, only using the discard at the start of my next turn then letting it be destroyed.</span></p>",
